content.text:
The root cause is the attractions service, and its effect reaches users through frontend's attractions-backed endpoints. Other services show only normal-range noise.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "attractions",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT metric, attr_k8s_pod_name, count(*) AS n, min(value) AS min_v, max(value) AS max_v FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric = 'k8s.container.restarts' AND attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'attractions%' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "The attractions pod's restart counter climbed from 0 to 3–6 during the abnormal window; it was 0 in normal."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'normal' AS period, service_name, count(*) AS spans FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name = 'attractions' GROUP BY ALL UNION ALL SELECT 'abnormal' AS period, service_name, count(*) AS spans FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name = 'attractions' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Attractions emitted 289 spans in the normal window and none in the abnormal window; it went silent."
        },
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT 'abnormal' AS period, metric, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'attractions%' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "No abnormal-period CPU, memory or filesystem metrics exist for the attractions pod, so it stopped reporting."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "attractions",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) AS c, sum(CASE WHEN attr_status_code = 'Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS errs FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name = 'frontend' AND span_name IN ('HTTP /cinema', 'HTTP /museums', 'HTTP /restaurants', 'HTTP /hotels', 'HTTP /recommendations') GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY span_name",
          "claim": "Frontend's /cinema, /museums and /restaurants requests all error (about 100% of them) while /hotels and /recommendations stay error-free."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

